{"title":"the eye of the storm, libra III","link":"https://keningzhu.com/journal/eye-of-the-storm-libra-iii","date":1761140100000,"content":"<figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4c1485ac-3c6a-4d06-9220-48d28ac74a71/libraIII.png?format=1000w\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4c1485ac-3c6a-4d06-9220-48d28ac74a71/libraIII.png?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4c1485ac-3c6a-4d06-9220-48d28ac74a71/libraIII.png?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4c1485ac-3c6a-4d06-9220-48d28ac74a71/libraIII.png?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4c1485ac-3c6a-4d06-9220-48d28ac74a71/libraIII.png?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4c1485ac-3c6a-4d06-9220-48d28ac74a71/libraIII.png?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4c1485ac-3c6a-4d06-9220-48d28ac74a71/libraIII.png?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4c1485ac-3c6a-4d06-9220-48d28ac74a71/libraIII.png?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n \n\n\n  <p><em>this series is inspired by my collaboration with </em><a href=\"https://www.ceremony-studio.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\"><em>LJ of Ceremony</em></a><em> for their communal writing practice, </em><a href=\"https://www.ceremony-studio.co.uk/atmospheres\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Atmospheres</em></a><em>, based of the 36 decans of the astrological year. </em></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n<hr />\n\n\n  <p><strong><em>Libra III</em></strong><em> — </em>14 October – 22 October<em><br /></em><strong><em>Key themes from LJ</em></strong><em> — </em>eye of the storm, altitude pressure, inner strength.<em><br /></em><strong><em>Before this: </em></strong><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/zone-of-a-creative-promise-libra-ii\" target=\"_blank\"><em>zone of the creative promise, libra II</em></a><em><br /><br />*</em></p><p>in creating this decan illustration, I spent time meditating on the quality of strength and grace that it takes to ground in a core, moving center — to cultivate spaciousness in the eye of the storm — even while external chaos swirls around you. as I get older, it seems that a sign of growth and maturity as a human being <em>is</em> this capacity for calm and inner stability, no matter what happens. there is a lightness in this self-equalizing energy of Libra that I admire, and would like to borrow from. </p><p>I’m coming to understand that, regardless of any accruement of adulthood I collect, my life will never resemble the standard image of “stability” that is prescribed to us. this understanding comes as a relief. I’ll always be destined for storms and chaos. growth here doesn’t mean a more static, motionless world, but an strengthening center that has even greater capacity to hold all storms. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n <hr />\n\n\n  <h1>process</h1>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d7d9af0f-321b-4677-a62f-d8a54e715819/libra_iii-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=1000w\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d7d9af0f-321b-4677-a62f-d8a54e715819/libra_iii-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d7d9af0f-321b-4677-a62f-d8a54e715819/libra_iii-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d7d9af0f-321b-4677-a62f-d8a54e715819/libra_iii-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d7d9af0f-321b-4677-a62f-d8a54e715819/libra_iii-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d7d9af0f-321b-4677-a62f-d8a54e715819/libra_iii-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d7d9af0f-321b-4677-a62f-d8a54e715819/libra_iii-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d7d9af0f-321b-4677-a62f-d8a54e715819/libra_iii-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n<hr />\n\n\n  <p><strong>explore</strong> <a href=\"https://www.ceremony-studio.co.uk/atmospheres\" target=\"_blank\">atmospheres, with LJ of Ceremony</a><br /><strong>see all</strong> <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/tag/atmospheres\" target=\"_blank\">atmospheres illustrations</a><br /><strong>more</strong> <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/visual-art\" target=\"_blank\">visual art</a></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n ","author":"Kening Zhu","siteTitle":"keni